# Files excluded from the published pub.dev archive.
#
# NOTE: where a .pubignore exists, pub uses it *instead of* the .gitignore in
# the same directory, so the root .gitignore's rules are repeated below.
# (.gitignore files in subdirectories, e.g. example/, still apply.)
#
# Measured, not assumed: with only the `docs/` rule below, the single extra file
# that ships is winche_storage.iml. pub excludes .dart_tool/, /build/,
# /coverage/ and pubspec.lock by its own built-in rules either way. The mirrored
# block is therefore belt-and-braces — keep it so a new root .gitignore entry
# doesn't silently start shipping, but don't expect it to be load-bearing.

# ── Not for consumers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Design specs and implementation plans: internal working documents, and about
# half the archive by size. Nothing here helps someone using the package.
docs/
.claude/

# ── Mirrors the root .gitignore from here down ──────────────────────────────

# Miscellaneous
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
.atom/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
migrate_working_dir/

# IntelliJ related
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
/build/
/coverage/
